WEBVTT

00:00:29.208 --> 00:00:32.065
"Inatokea maeneo gani,
inatokea hapa?"

00:00:32.089 --> 00:00:36.188
Na ninapojibu hayo maswali,
watu huwa wanashangazwa.

00:00:36.212 --> 00:00:38.213
Wanashangazwa na ukubwa wa ukatili,

00:00:38.237 --> 00:00:40.244
wanashangazwa na asili ya ukatili.

00:00:40.268 --> 00:00:41.855
Lakini mara zote ninakuwa 
mwepesi kuhakikisha

00:00:41.879 --> 00:00:44.720
Kuwa watu hawaachwi katika hali ya
majonzi na huzuni.

00:00:45.085 --> 00:00:48.796
Ninaamini tunayo fursa adimu
ya kihistoria

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:50.066
katika kizazi hiki

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:52.245
kutokomeza ukatili dhidi ya watoto

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:55.520
Kuna harakati zinazokua kuhusiana na hili.

00:00:56.065 --> 00:00:58.823
Serikali, serikali za kitaifa, 
serikali za majiji,

00:00:58.847 --> 00:01:01.466
majimbo na wengine
wanajiunga katika harakati hizo.